  "description": "Kang Seong-Ho’s wedding ring, which had fallen into his hands by chance. It would have been over if he had simply returned it. But on a sudden impulse, Choi Yun-Jae hides the ring’s whereabouts and finds himself confronting a darkness he must never let his older brother see. Is it loyalty, or obsession? Or perhaps a desire he cannot even admit to himself? \n\nWhat exactly awaits at the end of this dangerous relationship?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
